OL,3,GNEWSAA number of deaths reported after
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is believed that a number of people
OL,7,Fmay have died following a house fire in
OL,8,FWaterford city in the Republic of
OL,9,FIreland.
OL,11,FIt happened at a housing estate in the
OL,12,FBirchwood area, just off the Killure
OL,13,FRoad, and emergency services remain at
OL,14,Fthe scene.
OL,16,FThe Taoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,17,FMicheal Martin said that although he
OL,18,Fdid not yet have the full details it
OL,19,Fwas a "very worrying and deeply
OL,20,Fdisturbing situation".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
