OL,3,GNEWSAA number of deaths reported after
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, gardai said that
OL,7,Fbecause it was an "ongoing evolving
OL,8,Fincident" they were not in a position
OL,9,Fto provide any further information at
OL,10,Fpresent.
